        "en": "Morze, rzeka, góry, jeziora"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "In the north Poland lies on the sea, *nad morzem*: *nad Bałtykiem*. *Wisła*, the longest river, *najdłuższa rzeka*, runs into it. In the south are the mountains, and the most popular with tourists, *najbardziej turystyczne*, are *Tatry*. In the north-east is *Mazury*, a region, *region*, of a thousand lakes: *jezioro*, *jeziora*."
      }
    }
